Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:10.42,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:15.84,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:18.43,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flag that called forth oaths{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.35,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}chikai atsumeta hata{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep fighting on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:24.10,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tatakai tsudukete iku{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay true to yourself{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:28.85,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"jibunjishin" tsuranuke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seize it, dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:33.19,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tsukami toru Dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.61,0:01:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't lose, I'll never run away{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.61,0:01:38.57,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}makerarenai nige ya shinai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Transcend meetings and \Npartings and keep going{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:42.08,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deai wakare koe ikou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all treasures{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:46.41,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}zenbu takaramono{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:49.62,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:52.75,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:57.47,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:01.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the second year\Nsince Oden returned to the Land of Wano,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:17.76,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the battle between the Gecko Pirates and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:20.51,Italics,,0,0,0,,the Animal Kingdom Pirates \Ntook place in Ringo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gecko Moria and Kaido clashed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the same time,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the God of the Blade Ryuma's \Ngrave was vandalized.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And even under these circumstances...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, radish, {\i0}ganmo{\i1}!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:46.22,On Top,,0,0,0,,EGG
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chikuwa{\i1} and eggs!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One, two, three, go ahead and eat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden showed up in the Flower Capital once a week\Nand made a fool of himself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna dance, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The essential factor for \Nthe taste is the stock!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden{\i1} wouldn't be {\i0}oden{\i1}...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:17.88,On Top,,0,0,0,,HAKUMAI
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...if it wasn't boiled!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that silly lord again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for the people of Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The silly lord of Kuri, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's overpraise to even call him a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you guys to \Nstill serve me as my retainers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.56,On Top,,0,0,0,,ODEN CASTLE, KURI
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where else would we be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've seen Oden-sama's naked dance\Nsince the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's nothing new!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, I'll keep working on my dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My naked dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Konbu{\i1}, important!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan has hit bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard his son and heir Momonosuke-sama\Nis a fool, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The essential factor for \Nthe taste is the stock!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden{\i1} wouldn't be {\i0}oden{\i1}...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...if it wasn't boiled!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole clan will dance naked in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Raid!\NOden and the Akazaya Nine!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,--No!\N--I said "Wait"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I finally made my family targets of scorn...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna practice today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I love your dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?\NAre you trying to make me angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The silly lord of Kuri.\NThe whole Land of Wano called him so,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and only his family, retainers, and a few supporters\Nwould speak with him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd like to see Boss Hyogoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa!\NStay away from him, you silly lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky! Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ma'am!\N--Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Now come in and have some tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyo-san! Oden-chan's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi won't leave me alone!\NWho would wanna serve a guy like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't put yourself in danger, Hyo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-chan, your dancing's improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh please, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Have another cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Three years pass.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, radish, {\i0}ganmo{\i1}!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chikuwa{\i1} and eggs!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's here again this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in this snow?\NHe's a helpless silly lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden{\i1} wouldn't be {\i0}oden{\i1}...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Oden! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as stupid as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools do not know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Oden-sama has a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why he...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that dance is getting \Nbetter and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's watch him no matter \Nhow long it goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The snow is killing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shame on you!\N--You're disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--So annoying.\N--Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In a flash, four years passed,\Nbut nothing changed in the Land of Wano.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the fifth year, Orochi made a move.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Shogun! Shogun Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been exactly five years since that day.\NThe time has finally come...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you make that wild Kuri\Ninto a nice little town like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna build several weapon factories here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your cooperation, Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Shogun, what about the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,About the promise you and Kaido made...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I catch everyone around here\Nand force them to labor day and night,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have good productivity!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Land of Wano a \Nweapon manufacturing hub!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro was too much to handle for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so I left him in Kaido's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to have the Land of Wano's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,underworld ruler as my \Nsubordinate, but I gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he might be killed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His underlings annoyingly fought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back our boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So it took more trouble than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\Nremember Hyogoro's wife, that old bag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she screamed\Nand threw herself on them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She got shot to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Don't take him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyo... {\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As the wife of a yakuza,\Nshe shouldn't have acted so disgracefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, your children...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke and Hiyori.\NHow old are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Children are cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they're extremely cute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave the construction of the factories\Nto you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden-{\i0}chan{\i1}.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It must've been cold today to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My lady, coldness isn't a big deal to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard someone threw a stone at you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That happened today, too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're hanging tough!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're welcome to visit us anytime.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're always on your side.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to be like you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah? Then, eat a lot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to dance like you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oden!\N--Oden-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As his family and retainers had expected,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this great samurai has been carrying something\Non his shoulders all by himself for five years.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...and Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been waiting for you to say that\Nall this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go to his island!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,While he sleeps after drinking, \Nwe'll cut his head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What you are about to see...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...is Kozuki Oden's commotion of a lifetime\Nwhich the whole Land of Wano wept at.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nine men who he took in\Nto become samurai gathered.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was twilight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bright red sun tinged the men\Nmarching bravely into battle with burning red,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and even the swords worn at their waists\Ndisplayed burning souls.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People later honored their intense loyalty,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and called them the Akazaya Nine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm jumping higher than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm jumping higher than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their enemy was Kaido.\NWithout setting their sights on anyone else,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they marched on,\Nbut this is sadly a thing of the past.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's waiting for them is\NKozuki Oden's public execution.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until the legendary hour\Nthat would go down to posterity,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}please watch without blinking your eyes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! From Oden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to Kuri. Bring me my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! That book is important to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! What is this all about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's subordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they all...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are hundreds of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Why is he here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:18:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they so prepared?!\NHow did they know that we were coming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there is a spy in your castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna turn my newly built mansion\Ninto a battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I came all the way to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,On that day, five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise with you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all a lie, wasn't it, Kaido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time,\Nwe thought we were at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd just come home\Nand if you joined hands with Hyogoro,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,all samurai and yakuza in the Land of Wano\Nwould've become our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't have that many \Nunderlings back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were a crazy man who wouldn't care\Nabout the toll of human life just as I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it would've been a tough battle for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you believed Orochi's words\Nand chose the way that no one would be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Newgate and Roger were\Ncertainly that kind of pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong, but naive in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A fool who kept dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Naked, laughed at, and scorned!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You no longer have the old Kozuki dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a good choice that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about the future now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow Oden-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.69,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! Is this how strong samurai are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.36,0:22:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate! We're not outnumbered!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance, advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow Oden-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.05,0:22:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,--Stop it, Hiyori!\N--Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I received a letter from Oden by a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It says, "My wife and children will be targeted.\NPlease save them."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropkick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke...\NI mean, Momonosuke-{\i1}sama {\i0}is already eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Otoki-san, you have to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If Oden loses...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.09,0:23:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,this country is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kaido's attack turns the Land \Nof Wano into a battlefield!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.69,0:23:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Burning with a flame of \Nhope they almost lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:28.20,Italics,,0,0,0,,Oden and the Akazaya members \Nopen the way for the future!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.44,0:23:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Putting the suffering he has \Nshouldered to the blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:33.35,Italics,,0,0,0,,Oden fights the source of evil head-on!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:35.87,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To take back the Land of Wano!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"The End of the Battle! Oden vs. Kaido!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.75,0:23:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.31,0:23:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:48.31,On Top,,0,0,0,,
